and not retreating.

250
00:21:14.854 --> 00:21:18.372
Its curiosity outweighs its fear.

251
00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:33.518
That is beautiful.

252
00:21:57.427 --> 00:21:59.608
Hello, Calvin.

253
00:22:02.002 --> 00:22:06.407
How does that feel, Hugh?
You're gonna be a daddy.

254
