273
00:23:09.827 --> 00:23:12.157
Guys, guys.

274
00:23:12.237 --> 00:23:14.460
Meet Mei.

275
00:23:15.794 --> 00:23:18.033
Hi Mei!

276
00:23:18.254 --> 00:23:20.592
