- She's beautiful, Sho.

284
00:23:39.882 --> 00:23:41.223
Thank you!

285
00:23:41.303 --> 00:23:43.805
Seriously, that kid had blue eyes.

286
00:24:56.391 --> 00:25:00.134
<i>EEI PILGRIM7 MISSION,
DAY 25</i>

287
00:25:06.295 --> 00:25:08.295
